<title>JAPAN: Shinkawa -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinkawa -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.27		vs	    9.70</p>
<p> Operating	    1.71		vs	    1.46</p>
<p> Current		1.77		vs	    1.70</p>
<p> Net		  848    million	  vs	  734    million</p>
<p> EPS		   42.31 yen	  vs	   41.24 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     20 million	  vs	  18 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinkawa Ltd is a leading manufacturer of wire bonders for ICs and die bonders.</p>
</text>
